Zahl der Familien die uns vertrauen sondern auch die Zahl der Freiwilligen die mitmachen wollen","authoredText":"Unsere Kleiderausgabe hilft nicht nur Flüchtlingen, sondern auch einheimischen Bedürftigen. Wir achten dabei besonders auf Fairness. Jede Familie erhält nicht nur einen Gutschein, sondern auch eine freundliche Beratung. Erschreckend viele Kinder kommen ohne passende Winterkleidung zu uns. Deshalb existiert unser Angebot nicht nur im Winter, sondern auch ganzjährig. So wächst nicht nur die Zahl der Familien, die uns vertrauen, sondern auch die Zahl der Freiwilligen, die mitmachen wollen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Jahresbericht: Unsere Kleiderausgabe für Bedürftige","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Timo, unsere Kleiderkammer hilft nicht nur Geflüchteten, sondern auch kinderreichen Familien.","speaker":"Miriam","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_023_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Das wusste ich gar nicht.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_023_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Und was bietet ihr genau an?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_023_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Nicht nur Kleidung, sondern auch eine kurze Beratung, wenn jemand Fragen hat.","speaker":"Miriam","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_023_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Das überrascht mich total.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_023_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":6,"text":"Kann ich morgen beim Sortieren helfen?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_023_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":7,"text":"Sehr gern — komm einfach um zehn, dann zeige ich dir alles.","speaker":"Miriam","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_023_L005","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Timo, unsere Kleiderkammer hilft nicht nur Geflüchteten, sondern auch kinderreichen Familien.","speaker":"Miriam","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_023_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Das wusste ich gar nicht. Und was bietet ihr genau an?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_023_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Nicht nur Kleidung, sondern auch eine kurze Beratung, wenn jemand Fragen hat.","speaker":"Miriam","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_023_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Das überrascht mich total. Kann ich morgen beim Sortieren helfen?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_023_L004","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":5,"text":"Sehr gern — komm einfach um zehn, dann zeige ich dir alles.","speaker":"Miriam","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_023_L005","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Wir helfen nicht nur Geflüchteten, sondern auch kinderreichen Familien.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Ein Freund fragt, wem die Kleiderkammer hilft.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Wir bieten nicht nur Kleidung, sondern auch Bettzeug an.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Er fragt, was ihr genau anbietet.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":3,"text":"Es läuft nicht nur regional, sondern auch bundesweit.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":3,"text":"Deine Chefin fragt, was das Projekt bemerkenswert macht.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":4,"text":"Ich organisiere nicht nur, sondern bringe auch neuen Helfern alles bei.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":4,"text":"Eine Kollegin fragt nach deiner Rolle.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":5,"text":"Sie schützt nicht nur die Spenden, sondern auch das Vertrauen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":5,"text":"Ein Bekannter fragt, warum die Disziplin wichtig ist.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":6,"text":"Wir sammeln nicht nur, sondern beraten auch. — Und wir brauchen nicht nur Kleidung, sondern auch Zeit.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-23-nicht-nur-sondern-auch","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":6,"text":"Rollenspiel: Ihr stellt die Kleiderkammer vor.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false}],"controls":{"story-play-line":6,"story-play-all":1,"vword-voice-F":54,"vword-voice-M":54,"vword-listen":54,"listen-to-passage":1,"audio-play-btn":1,"hear-model":6},"surfaces":[{"n":11,"w":"— (Sg.)","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":16,"w":"die","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":1,"w":"Bedürftige","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":4,"w":"der/die","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":11,"w":"der","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":1,"w":"Betreiber/innen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":6,"w":"das","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":1,"w":"Bundesverbände","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Cartoons","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Comics","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Diebstähle","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Dürreperioden","from":"vo